        "ImageDescription": {
          "value": "<p>McDonald's on the corner of International Drive and Sand Lake Drive\n</p>\n<pre>Let me first warn you to just stay away from this place. This is toted as the world's largest McDonald's but here's what they don't tell you. It is one of the dirtiest McDonald's I've been in, most crowded, worst parking lot trying to get out of.\nThese Tokens are only used for the machines where you drop a coin in to try to get more coins. These don't even have a McDonald's Logo on it. They Say 'Prime Time Amusements.\n</pre>\n<p>As for the games. The games are mainly \"ticket\" games with a couple video games thrown in. I put \"tickets\" in quotes because there are no tickets. You have to buy a rechargeable card with credits on it. You then swipe the card on the games you want to play. If you win any \"tickets\", the number will be placed on your card. You do not actually receive any physical tickets. Also the games are over priced. Galaga was 3 credits. \n</p><p>Please avoid this place!!\n</p><p>McDonald's Restaurants6875 West Sand Lake Road, \nOrlando, FL 32819\n(407) 351-2185\n</p>\nmcfun.com",
          "source": "commons-desc-page"
        },
